  {
   "id": "q-u-b-e-10th-anniversary-206756@1.2",
   "gameId": "q-u-b-e-10th-anniversary-206756",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-30T09:00:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary v1.2",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have listened to the community, taking on feedback and fixing issues. We'd like to thank everyone who has bought the game and joined in on the Discord server to express their feedback and opinions. Here's what we've changed in v1.2:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes -",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed floating panels in Sector 8. There was a misplaced panel floating in the middle of Sector 8!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues with key bindings. Keybindings would not rebind correctly!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue with Reset To Defaults in the options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Level Added -",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We took on the feedback from many of the community that loved a classic puzzle that was originally excluded from the game, and we recreated it. We have added Tough Going playable from the Extras menu - it's a blast from the past that we hope you'll enjoy, and not pull your hair out too much.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Until next time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Q.U.B.E. team.: Toxic Games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
    "new": 3,
    "fixed": 2,
    "balance": 0,
    "other": 1,
    "ps5": 0,
    "topNew": [
     "Until next time!",
     "The Q.U.B.E. team.: Toxic Games."
    ]
   },
